# A new street runs a block past its crossroads each way. Road pieces lay it
# on, a block at a time, from either end: a road runs on past its last plot,
# and never over another road's end.
> new empty
> free on
> construction off
> build crossroads at s0:28
  #1 intersection at s0:28-30, done
> streets
  s0  runs east (lots on its north side), cells 10..252
  s1  runs north (lots on its west side), cells 121..141, from crossroads #1
    crossroads #1: s0:29 = s1:131 (cell A29)
> ride #last
  rider: s0:29 facing +
> turn up
  rider: s1:131 facing +
> lay road 8
  s1 now runs cells 121..165
> ride s1:158
  rider: s1:158 facing +
> build crossroads here
  #15 intersection at s1:157-159, done
> ride #last
  rider: s1:158 facing +
> turn up
  rider: s2:131 facing +
> lay road 8
  s2 now runs cells 121..165
> ride s2:158
  rider: s2:158 facing +
> build crossroads here
  #24 intersection at s2:157-159, done
> ride #last
  rider: s2:158 facing +
> turn up
  rider: s3:131 facing +
# the fourth street runs south at column 2, past the main street's west end
> lay road 10
  s3 now runs cells 121..171
> streets
  s0  runs east (lots on its north side), cells 10..252
  s1  runs north (lots on its west side), cells 121..165, from crossroads #1
  s2  runs west (lots on its south side), cells 121..165, from crossroads #15
  s3  runs south (lots on its east side), cells 121..171, from crossroads #24
    crossroads #1: s0:29 = s1:131 (cell A29)
    crossroads #15: s1:158 = s2:131 (cell AB29)
    crossroads #24: s2:158 = s3:131 (cell AB2)
