# The rocks lie inside squares of the road grid: a street laid on past them
# runs on beside them.
> new empty
> free on
> construction off
> build crossroads at s0:55
  #1 intersection at s0:55-57, done
> build crossroads at s0:82
  #7 intersection at s0:82-84, done
> ride #last
  rider: s0:83 facing +
> turn up
