> lay road 8
  s2 now runs cells 121..165
> streets
  s0  runs east (lots on its north side), cells 10..252
  s1  runs north (lots on its west side), cells 121..141, from crossroads #1
  s2  runs north (lots on its west side), cells 121..165, from crossroads #7
    crossroads #1: s0:56 = s1:131 (cell A56)
    crossroads #7: s0:83 = s2:131 (cell A83)
